# Phase 1 - Brainstorming & Ideation

## Project Title

Import Data using Transform Maps (Spreadsheet)

## Problem Statement

Entering a large amount of data manually into ServiceNow can take more time and may cause data entry errors.

## Proposed Solution

Import spreadsheet data into ServiceNow using Import Sets and Transform Maps.

## Idea

The project will take employee information from a spreadsheet and import it into a ServiceNow table.

## Benefits

- Saves time
- Reduces manual data entry
- Improves data accuracy
- Supports bulk data import
- Makes data migration easier
